    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the mouse and slide on the screen to generate the corresponding pattern. Use the generated pattern to guide the ball to the destination to complete the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fun gameplay elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw any path freely and make the ball follow your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the &quot;space&quot; key to freeze the generated path, allowing it to fall to your desired position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ball touches the blue ball, it will be teleported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it touches the green ball, it will bounce in a specified direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball has elasticity, and you can use this feature to help it reach the destination!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful scenes and immersive music.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the mouse and slide on the screen to generate the corresponding pattern. Use the generated pattern to guide the ball to the destination to complete the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fun gameplay elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw any path freely and make the ball follow your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the &quot;space&quot; key to freeze the generated path, allowing it to fall to your desired position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ball touches the blue ball, it will be teleported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it touches the green ball, it will bounce in a specified direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball has elasticity, and you can use this feature to help it reach the destination!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful scenes and immersive music.</p>",
